35%，台電占30%，軌道交通占15至20%，AIDC占5至10%。亞力指出，公司業務重心已從台電轉至半導體產業。同時，公司積極布局海外，半導體客戶的美國第三期訂單於本季接單、明年出貨，日本也於本季接單，預計今年底至明年第一季出貨。 亞力9月營收9.81億元，月增26.8%，年增10.4%；第三季營收26.5億元，季減6%，年減5.76%；累計今年前三季營收80.25億元，年增8.24%。","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["訂單/接單","營收","AI/半導體"],"bull":["訂單","成長","受惠"],"bear":["下滑"],"score":4,"highlights":["年增7.19%","年增2.79%","年增10.4%"],"keywords":["重電","變壓器","華城","亞力","士電","中興電"]},"time":"10/26 09:14"}],"fund":{"code":"1514","rev_month":"11509","rev":980973.0,"rev_mom":26.802624537564856,"rev_yoy":10.400310614927523,"rev_cum_yoy":8.237085789371035,"eps_q":null,"eps_year":null,"eps_season":null,"net_income":null,"pe":22.93,"pb":3.6,"yield":2.63,"updated":"2026-11-06 17:49"},"tdcc":{"latest":{"date":"2026-10-30","big1000":34.34,"big400":41.01,"retail":34.58,"holders":100450},"prev":{"date":"2026-10-22","big1000":34.77,"big400":40.98,"retail":34.66,"holders":100732},"d_big1000":-0.43,"d_big400":0.03,"d_retail":-0.08,"d_holders":-282},"weekly":{"bars":[{"time":"2026-07-27","open":107.0,"high":107.0,"low":90.2,"close":97.6,"volume":10514.776},{"time":"2026-08-03","open":96.6,"high":103.0,"low":96.0,"close":99.8,"volume":5779.175000000001},{"time":"2026-08-10","open":99.9,"high":104.5,"low":99.8,"close":101.0,"volume":7327.768},{"time":"2026-08-17","open":101.0,"high":103.0,"low":98.2,"close":102.5,"volume":4563.337},{"time":"2026-08-24","open":103.5,"high":111.5,"low":99.2,"close":105.0,"volume":11726.09},{"time":"2026-08-31","open":104.0,"high":107.0,"low":100.5,"close":102.0,"volume":8199.894},{"time":"2026-09-07","open":103.5,"high":105.0,"low":100.0,"close":100.5,"volume":4354.251},{"time":"2026-09-14","open":100.0,"high":102.0,"low":99.4,"close":101.5,"volume":4070.422},{"time":"2026-09-21","open":102.0,"high":105.0,"low":100.0,"close":102.0,"volume":4866.523},{"time":"2026-09-29","open":101.5,"high":103.5,"low":101.0,"close":102.5,"volume":3216.1400000000003},{"time":"2026-10-05","open":103.0,"high":105.5,"low":102.0,"close":102.5,"volume":4685.972000000001